Subject: [PATCH] fix(hud): translate remote player locations into waypoints

Bedrock sends locator positions for players outside simulation distance through
PlayerLocation. Translate those updates into Java tracked waypoints and remove
them when Bedrock hides a player, the player leaves, or the dimension changes.

The protocol 2193 packet carries both a variant index and a location
discriminator; consume both fields before reading coordinates.
